<!--
  Colors — Night drive (Drive mode, dark)
  Low-glare dimmed teal for dark roads (all text still ≥ 4.5:1)
  Place in: rro/night_drive/res/values-night/colors.xml
  Resource names are IDENTICAL in every theme: a theme is just a different set of values.
  Drive modes ship as runtime resource overlays (RRO) that override these same names.
-->
